title: "geodesic-integrators"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Systematic comparison of explicit Runge-Kutta, Gauss-Legendre and Tao integrators for
  timelike and null geodesics around a Schwarzschild black hole, in the second-order and the
  Hamiltonian formulation, validated against closed-form solutions.
